  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689644",
      "title": "Adding a Re-Usable \"Modal\" Component",
      "lectureOrder": 77,
      "videoOrder": 68,
      "sourceHash": "96d3bbc0486603faf1a9479f11c4df3631f110e796e88ab6fbe6e277f3c3dd5f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 9.16,
          "en": "Now to conclude this course section, let's also put the edit meetup component into a modal so that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 9.16,
          "end": 16.36,
          "en": "we don't open this form here above the meetup grid, but instead as an overlay in a modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 16.54,
          "end": 21.19,
          "en": "Hence I'll add a modal dot svelte file here in the UI folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 22.68,
          "end": 23.34,
          "en": "And in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 23.34,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "Let's start with the markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 25.2,
          "end": 28.42,
          "en": "We'll need two divs in this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 30.33,
          "en": "One is the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 31.59,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "We can add it with modal dash backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 41.04,
          "en": "So that is the grayish transparent backdrop backdrop that prevents clicks on the other content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 41.4,
          "end": 44.34,
          "en": "And the other div is for the modal itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 44.43,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "There I'll give it a class of modal and inside of that modal of course you can structure this however",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.24,
          "en": "you want, but I want to have a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 55.31,
          "end": 64.4,
          "en": "I also want to have a div that holds my content and I also want to provide a footer area where people",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 64.4,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "can pass in their own footer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 68.93,
          "en": "So for example, buttons that close the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 70.34,
          "end": 73.42,
          "en": "Now I'll work with a couple of slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 73.43,
          "end": 79.13,
          "en": "First of all, the title, we could use a slot here, but since I use a H1 tag here, I pretty much",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 79.13,
          "end": 81.14,
          "en": "only want to output some text in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 81.14,
          "end": 85.27,
          "en": "Hence I will indeed use a normal prop there for the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 85.28,
          "end": 91.91,
          "en": "However, a slot makes sense so that any content you want can be passed in here, be that a text message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 91.91,
          "end": 93.41,
          "en": "or a complex form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 93.68,
          "end": 101.78,
          "en": "And for the footer I'll also add a slot, a slot with a name of footer that allows us to target this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 101.78,
          "end": 105.22999999999999,
          "en": "slot specifically for content that should go into the footer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 105.41,
          "end": 108.92,
          "en": "I also want to provide a default content here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 108.95,
          "end": 114.32,
          "en": "A default button which can be used to close the modal where I simply say close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 115.22,
          "end": 117.22999999999999,
          "en": "Now we need to import some stuff.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 117.22999999999999,
          "end": 125.75,
          "en": "So here let's add script tags and let's import the button from the button dot svelte file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.87,
          "end": 131.45,
          "en": "Let's also export the title variable so that this can be set as a prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 135.43,
          "en": "And of course we need to add some styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 135.45,
          "end": 140.48,
          "en": "Now you find these styles attached to this lecture again in the CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 140.49,
          "end": 145.27,
          "en": "Simply take the content of that file and insert it here between the style tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 145.29,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "And this should give you some nice modal styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 148.95,
          "end": 156.24,
          "en": "With that in place, we can start using the modal to show our edit meetup content inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 157.85,
          "end": 164.06,
          "en": "Now let's go to the edit meetup page here and wrap this in a modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 164.06,
          "end": 170.27,
          "en": "So in edit meetup dot svelte, I'll import the modal from the UI folder and there from the modal dot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 170.27,
          "end": 171.26,
          "en": "svelte file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 177.01,
          "end": 183.4,
          "en": "And now if I go down here, this entire form will be wrapped in the modal selector.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 184.52,
          "end": 186.98,
          "en": "So let's do that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 191.32,
          "end": 192.28,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 192.91,
          "end": 193.87,
          "en": "And all in the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 193.87,
          "end": 200.98,
          "en": "We need to set a title and the title here could be added meetup data or whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 202.59,
          "end": 209.34,
          "en": "Then this entire content here, which has no information about the slot it wants to target, will automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 209.34,
          "end": 210.87,
          "en": "go into the default slot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 210.87,
          "end": 216.54,
          "en": "And for now I'll not provide content for the footer slot and hence this default should be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 217.38,
          "end": 218.61,
          "en": "Let's give this a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 218.64,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "Let's save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 220.84,
          "end": 222.73,
          "en": "And click the new meet up button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 222.85,
          "end": 223.99,
          "en": "Here's our modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 224.23,
          "end": 229.21,
          "en": "Doesn't look too bad, but of course the save button is a bit out of place now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 229.82999999999998,
          "end": 233.19,
          "en": "And looks really strange in conjunction with the close button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 233.31,
          "end": 234.82999999999998,
          "en": "So let's work on that a bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 238.5,
          "en": "Let's go back to edit Meetup and first of all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 239.04,
          "end": 242.31,
          "en": "Let's remove this submit button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 243.61,
          "end": 246.91,
          "en": "Let's comment it out and with it, comment it out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 247.95,
          "end": 254.91,
          "en": "Let's also adjust the styling of the form a little bit and give it a width of 100%, actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 256.04,
          "end": 260.48,
          "en": "And remove all the other styling so that it takes the full width of the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 261.91,
          "end": 263.93,
          "en": "Now this looks a bit nicer in my opinion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 263.95,
          "end": 266.67,
          "en": "It's a bit scrollable because I'm also zoomed in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 266.71,
          "end": 268.45,
          "en": "Should be fine here on bigger screens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 268.45,
          "end": 269.77,
          "en": "It will not be scrollable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 270.13,
          "end": 270.97,
          "en": "This looks good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 270.97,
          "end": 271.78,
          "en": "We have the close button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 271.78,
          "end": 275.83,
          "en": "But of course this button doesn't do anything as you clicks on the backdrop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 275.83,
          "end": 278.74,
          "en": "So next step is to make sure that this modal is closable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 278.74,
          "end": 281.89,
          "en": "And we actually saw that already in the previous course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 282.04,
          "end": 287.53,
          "en": "Let's go to the modal component and let's make sure that we emit some custom events when we click on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 287.53,
          "end": 291.34000000000003,
          "en": "the backdrop or when we click on the default button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 292.29,
          "end": 292.92,
          "en": "For that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 292.92,
          "end": 295.2,
          "en": "Again, we can import.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 297.33,
          "end": 300.15,
          "en": "The create this event dispatcher.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 300.87,
          "end": 302.01,
          "en": "Function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 302.7,
          "end": 311.25,
          "en": "From Svelte and we create a new function with the help of it and store that in the dispatch constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 311.52,
          "end": 313.77,
          "en": "And now when we click on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 314.66,
          "end": 320.21,
          "en": "This modal backdrop or on this button, I want to dispatch my own close event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 321.02,
          "end": 324.4,
          "en": "For that, let me shrink the style here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 324.41,
          "end": 325.88,
          "en": "I'll add a new function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 326.93,
          "end": 331.13,
          "en": "Name it Close modal and in there, simply dispatch a close event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 333.44,
          "end": 337.08,
          "en": "Or maybe a cancel event because we certainly didn't confirm anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 337.1,
          "end": 341.32,
          "en": "This is always something that should cancel the process that is currently ongoing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 341.33,
          "end": 342.47,
          "en": "So here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 343.37,
          "end": 344.3,
          "en": "On click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 344.33,
          "end": 350.3,
          "en": "I'll point at Close Modal and of course do the same for our default close button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 350.48,
          "end": 352.01,
          "en": "Close Modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 352.74,
          "end": 359.76,
          "en": "With that in place, we can go to edit Meetup where we use that modal and listen to our custom cancel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 359.76,
          "end": 360.3,
          "en": "event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 360.3,
          "end": 362.88,
          "en": "And this event should now close the modal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 362.91,
          "end": 370.26,
          "en": "Now I will actually simply forward this because I want to cancel this adding or editing process and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 370.26,
          "end": 374.75,
          "en": "since I started that in the app Svelte file, this is also where I want to end it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 374.76,
          "end": 381.99,
          "en": "Hence here in edit meetup where we use the modal I only forward the cancel event and in app svelte where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 381.99,
          "end": 388.35,
          "en": "we use edit meetup here we can now listen to on cancel as well because we are forwarding that and in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 388.35,
          "end": 392.79,
          "en": "there we can now call a function which I have yet to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 395,
          "end": 399.59000000000003,
          "en": "Cancel edit which will simply set edit mode to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 399.59000000000003,
          "end": 401.4,
          "en": "And that is all for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 401.42,
          "end": 403.67,
          "en": "So it sets edit mode to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 403.90999999999997,
          "end": 407.18,
          "en": "And here I connect that by setting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 407.82,
          "end": 411.27,
          "en": "This event listener equal to the cancel edit function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 411.51,
          "end": 416.64,
          "en": "If you now save that and you go back and you click this button and click the backdrop, this gets cancelled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 416.64,
          "end": 418.62,
          "en": "If I enter something there, click close.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 418.62,
          "end": 419.61,
          "en": "This gets cancelled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 419.64,
          "end": 423.06,
          "en": "Next time we start with new data and I can cancel this.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
